"OrchardCore.DataPipelines.Views.Items.RunDataPipelineTask.Fields.Edit"
msgid "Skip when a run is already queued or running"
msgstr "如果运行已排队或正在运行，则跳过"

#: Views/Items/RunDataPipelineTask.Fields.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt ""
"OrchardCore.DataPipelines.Views.Items.RunDataPipelineTask.Fields.Edit"
msgid ""
"The published version of the pipeline runs in the background, with the "
"access of the user who published it."
msgstr "以发布者的身份在后台运行已发布版本的数据管道。"

#: Views/Items/RunDataPipelineTask.Fields.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt ""
"OrchardCore.DataPipelines.Views.Items.RunDataPipelineTask.Fields.Edit"
msgid ""
"The workflow then continues with the Skipped outcome instead of queuing "
"another run, such as when a timer starts it more often than a run lasts."
msgstr "工作流随后通过“已跳过”结果继续，而不是再次排队运行，例如计时器启动运行的频率高于运行持续时间时。"

#: Views/Items/RunDataPipelineTask.Fields.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt ""
"OrchardCore.DataPipelines.Views.Items.RunDataPipelineTask.Fields.Edit"
msgid ""
"The workflow then continues with the Succeeded or Failed outcome, and the "
"run as its last result and its DataPipelineRun output. Otherwise it "
"continues at once with the Queued outcome."
msgstr ""
"工作流随后通过“已成功”或“失败”结果继续，并将运行作为最后一个结果及其 DataPipelineRun 输出。否则，工作流立即通过“已排队”结果继续。"

#. Format arguments: {0}: "{Parameter:name}"
#: Views/Items/RunDataPipelineTask.Fields.Edit.cshtml
#, csharp-format
msgctxt ""
"OrchardCore.DataPipelines.Views.Items.RunDataPipelineTask.Fields.Edit"
msgid ""
"Values passed to the run, one name=value per line, with Liquid. Steps use "
"them with the {0} placeholder, such as in the parameters and filters of a "
"data source."
msgstr "传递给运行的值，每行填写一个名称=值，并支持 Liquid。步骤可以通过 {0} 占位符使用这些值，例如在数据源的参数和筛选器中。"

#: Views/Items/RunDataPipelineTask.Fields.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt ""
"OrchardCore.DataPipelines.Views.Items.RunDataPipelineTask.Fields.Edit"
msgid "Wait for the run to end"
msgstr "等待运行结束"

